  "Description": {
    "Cost": 1567124,
    "UIName": "Buccaneer",
    "Id": "chassisdef_buccaneer_BCN-3R",
    "Name": "Buccaneer",
    "Details": "Designed primarily for short range combat, the Buccaneer carries a single ER large laser to give it some striking capability at long ranges. With the elevation of physical combat to an art in the Inner Sphere, the Buccaneer's most fearsome weapon is its four ton hatchet, supported at medium to close ranges by four medium lasers, a highly accurate medium pulse laser, and a SRM-6 with an Artemis IV guidance system for increased missile accuracy.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_buccaneer"
  },
  "VariantName": "BCN-3R",
  "ChassisTags": {
    "items": [
      "mr-resize-1.14-0.9-0.9"
    ]
  },
  "StockRole": "Skirmisher",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Buccaneer is a product of the Word of Blake's voracious appetite for military equipment in its first few years, as the order had far more MechWarriors than they had 'Mechs. The Buccaneer was originally designed to be used by ComStar, but had not begun production. When the schism that created the Word of Blake occurred, the design was modified to accommodate equipment available to the Word of Blake in their temporary home of the Free Worlds League. The Buccaneer is built with a lightweight VOX 330 XL engine giving the 'Mech a top speed of 97.2 km/h. It also carries an impressive ten tons of ferro-fibrous armor, the maximum amount of protection the chassis can carry, and mounts 10 double heat sinks as standard.",
